## Motion (v2 contract)

**Default easing:** `--motion-ease: ease-in-out` on every enter, exit, cascade, and transition in v2 UI. No bounce, spring, or overshoot `cubic-bezier` unless the user explicitly asks. New motion must use `var(--motion-ease)`, not hardcoded `ease-out` / `ease-in`.

**Reduced motion:** `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` — skip decorative loops; snap to end states.

### Bottom sheets / modals (slide up + backdrop fade)

| Pattern | Keyframes | Duration token | JS constant | JS helpers |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Standard sheet | `sheetSlideIn` / `sheetSlideOut` + `sheetBackdropIn` / `sheetBackdropOut` | `--sheet-slide-ms` (420) | `SHEET_SLIDE_MS`, `MODAL_ANIM_MS`, `PROFILE_SLIDE_MS` | `openOverlay()` / `closeOverlay()` |
| Outcome (success/fail) | same slide keyframes | `--success-enter-ms` (550) | `SUCCESS_ENTER_MS`, `SUCCESS_SLIDE_MS` | `openOutcomeOverlay()`, `closeScheduleSuccessModal()`, `closeScheduleFailModal()` |
| Profile menu | same slide keyframes | `--profile-enter-ms` (= success enter) | `PROFILE_ENTER_MS`, `PROFILE_SLIDE_MS` | `openProfileMenu()` / `closeProfileMenu()` |
| Profile enter | all sections visible; stars + JS 0→N count-up after sheet lands | reuses `--success-*` via `--profile-*` / `--profile-count-ms` | `PROFILE_CASCADE_MS` (= enter + count) | `.is-entering` on overlay; `animateProfileStatCount` |

**Open:** remove `hidden` + `is-closing`, reflow, add `is-open`. **Close:** add `is-closing`, wait for slide duration, then remove `is-open` and set `hidden`. Never hide synchronously on close — the exit animation never plays.

**Enter vs exit keyframes:** always separate `@keyframes` for in and out. `animation-direction: reverse` on a finished animation snaps to the end.

**Exit rule (all sheets):** only the **panel + backdrop** animate on close. Inner content holds its entered state (outcome sheets: `.success-overlay.is-open.is-closing` hold rules for cards/copy/stars). Do not reverse inner cascades on exit.

**Uses standard slide:** `.wl-modal` (history, wrong URL, offline, delete confirm, mark-watched), `#schedPrefsOverlay`, `#profileOverlay`, `#multiSessionWhyOverlay`, `#logoutOverlay`, **`#onbPermsOverlay`**, **`#onbAnalyzeOverlay`**, **`#authFlowHost`**. **`#feedbackOverlay`** uses `.feedback-overlay` + its own slide helpers — not `.wl-modal`.

**Do not** fold success/fail or profile back into scale+fade `.wl-modal` morph, or morph `#schedSheet` into success.

### Schedule success / fail (`#successOverlay` / `#failOverlay`)

1. Sheet + backdrop slide in (`--success-enter-ms`, `--motion-ease`).
2. After sheet lands (`animation-delay: var(--success-enter-ms)`): both white cards fade **0→100% opacity** + rotate (ghost **+2°** / front **−2°**, `--success-card-ms`).
3. After cards finish (`delay: enter + card`): card text fades in (`successCardTextIn`, `--success-card-text-ms`) — title/time/error only, not visible during shell fade.
4. Copy cascade: heading → body → buttons (`successCopyIn`, `--success-copy-ms`, `--success-copy-stagger`).
5. Stars scale+rotate in on **success only** (`successStarIn`, `--success-star-ms`); fail has no stars.
5. Exit: sheet slides down only; inner state frozen via `.is-closing` hold rules.

Preview loop: `#preview=1&schedule=1&success=1` (or `&fail=1`) alternates success → fail. Tokens pair with `SUCCESS_*_MS` in `popup.js`; `tests/selfcheck.js` guards pairs.

### Toast (`#toast`)

Bottom center (`--toast-bottom-inset: 40px`): slides **up then down** — `toastSlideIn` / `toastSlideOut`, `--toast-slide-ms` ↔ `TOAST_SLIDE_MS`, hold **`--toast-hold-ms`: 1500ms** ↔ `TOAST_MS`.

### Onboarding

- **Pain/Promise card carousel:** `ease-in-out`, fade + 90%↔100% scale via `onb1CardSlot`; no bounce. Recycled card slot 3 rest = slot 0 end.
- **Ticker + copy morph:** animate **both** outgoing and incoming screens (`setOnbTickerActive`, `paintOnbCopySlots`). **Pain→Promise forward:** Promise uses `is-modal-shell-only` during crossfade (white modal only), then `playOnbModalEnter` — do not morph Promise copy in during fade.
- **Modal entry (Pain/Promise only):** `playOnbModalEnter` — lines rise → chip land → CTA slide. `--onb-modal-enter-ms` / `--onb-modal-enter-stagger` ↔ `ONB_MODAL_ENTER_MS` / `ONB_MODAL_STAGGER_MS`.
- **Calendar permissions sheet (`532:2481`):** on `#onboardingPromise` — `#onbPermsOverlay` / `#onbPermsSheet`. Promise **Next** → `openPromisePermsSheet()`. Black blur backdrop. Cards stagger (`--onb-perm-enter-ms` / `--onb-perm-stagger-ms` ↔ `PERMS_CARD_ENTER_MS` / `PERMS_CARD_STAGGER_MS`). **Allow** → Connecting stacks on open perms sheet (no close first). Standard `--sheet-slide-ms` slide.
- **Pink in-text chips:** `.onb-chip` is **`rotate(-2deg)`** globally — Pain/Promise onboarding chips use `--onb-chip-rot`; perms sheet chip **−1°**.

### History

- Tab/page repaint: opacity cross-fade `HISTORY_SWAP_MS`.
- Row delete/mark: slide left + height collapse (~350ms each phase).
- Hover actions: `max-width` + `margin-left`, never `display: none` → `flex`.

### Hover / layout animations

Anything that appears on hover must be animatable — collapse with `max-width` and animatable gap as `margin-left`.

